                                        "entry_id": "bf013af4-dc48-3c19-bac4-01f1b9290778",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Laziness; slowness in the mindset; disinclination to action or labour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e8e956b-2e05-45ed-8f1b-5a0e730dc3ef",
                                                "sense_id": "ba29c3ea-ba06-3e5b-9bc0-f01a9514355a",
                                                "text": "Who having ſpilt much blood, and don much waſte / Subduing Nations, and achievd thereby / Fame in the World, high titles, and rich prey, / Shall change thir courſe to pleaſure, eaſe, and ſloth, / Surfet, and luſt, till wantonneſs and pride / Raiſe out of friendſhip hoſtil deeds in Peace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "071c2aa2-046c-45cb-a705-2db00b1cf5d0",
                                                "sense_id": "ba29c3ea-ba06-3e5b-9bc0-f01a9514355a",
                                                "text": "Sloth, like rust, consumes faster than labour wears."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd50e91f-7c5f-4cfb-9daa-d29122d55853",
                                                "sense_id": "ba29c3ea-ba06-3e5b-9bc0-f01a9514355a",
                                                "text": "Mr. Elliot's frank statement that \"sloth and untidiness are indefensible\" is a sign that the task will be tackled with vigour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e2f0fb5-f3da-3ed7-af4b-acd79f6289fc",
                                        "entry_id": "bf013af4-dc48-3c19-bac4-01f1b9290778",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any animal in the suborder Folivora.",
                                            "Any herbivorous, arboreal South American mammal of the families Choloepodidae and Bradypodidae, noted for its slowness and inactivity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "especially",
