                                                "example_id": "f4cf9f5b-815a-413d-bb69-18b953eb5b29",
                                                "sense_id": "fc625e79-9a54-38bf-a310-eff1880f73ee",
                                                "text": "That you endeavour carefully to please your Lady, Master or Mistress, be faithful, diligent and submissive to them, encline not to sloth or laze in bed, but rise early in a morning."
